### Pomodoria API — use REST Client (VS Code) or similar
### After login/register, copy token into @token for protected routes.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT_FROM_LOGIN_OR_REGISTER

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. Create session (requires Bearer token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "focus",
  "duration": 25,
  "startTime": "2026-05-02T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-05-02T10:25:00.000Z",
  "completed": true
}

### 4. Get stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
